# autodemo demoing itself: check + preview of the ls demo
Size 100x24
Theme dark
Title "autodemo"
Setup printf "PS1='\\$ '\n" > $HOME/.bashrc
Cd /tmp
Transition in slide-in 400ms
Transition out wipe 400ms
Slide "autodemo" "scripted demos for READMEs" 1500ms
Run bash -i
Caption "Validate a script" bottom
Sleep 500ms
Send "/data/dev/github/autodemo/autodemo list 2>&1 | head; /data/dev/github/autodemo/autodemo check /data/dev/github/autodemo/.autodemo/examples/ls.demo" 25
SendKey Enter
Sleep 2s
Caption "Bulk-check everything" bottom
Send "cd /data/dev/github/autodemo && ./autodemo bulk check 2>&1 | tail -8" 25
SendKey Enter
Sleep 3s
Loop
